    name="5 Statistical Product Composition Value Stream"
    id="id-6c90108c348b4d7da254bc66534dd5ce"
    documentation="Purpose:&#xD;&#xA;To synthesize and integrate multiple datasets or analyses into composite statistical products that provide comprehensive, multi-dimensional views of social or economic phenomena.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Description:&#xD;&#xA;This stream transforms analytical outputs into finalized statistical products such as time-series indicators, composite indices, dashboards, or analytical reports. Value is created through integration, interpretation, and insight generation — enabling users to derive meaning from complex datasets.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;The artefacts produced are composed statistical products — curated, documented, and quality-assured outputs ready for dissemination.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Key capabilities: Data Integration, Time Series Management, Index Construction, Analytical Product Design, Statistical Product Management."
